<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! The way it's going,
it won't even be an afternoon nap!</font>

47
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so...?
Call me when it is broken.</font>

48
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just wait!</font>

49
00:02:07,890 --> 00:02:11,690
