<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Pop, Water Balloon!</font>

52
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:39,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh man! Why doesn't it break!</font>

53
