<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't I tell you I can't give
a detailed explanation until it's broken?</font>

59
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I understand...</font>

60
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:17,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naturally, you're supposed to realize it
through trial and error</font>

61
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when mastering a Jutsu, but...</font>

62
00:03:20,970 --> 00:03:22,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah.</font>

63
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I'll teach you just
a tiny bit on the Jutsu...</font>

64
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, try rotating the water!</font>

65
00:03:29,930 --> 00:03:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, okay.</font>

66
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right or left... which direction did you
imagine when you rotate it?</font>

67
00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... well, to the left...</font>

68
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:48,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, come over here.</font>

69
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

70
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, I thought so...</font>

71
00:03:58,460 --> 00:04:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?</font>

72
00:04:00,670 --> 00:04:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are in fact a right-rotation type.</font>

73
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right?</font>

74
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to build up Chakra,</font>

75
00:04:07,260 --> 00:04:10,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it is necessary to blend the energy...</font>

76
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra... Spiritual energy... Physical energy...
So everybody</font>

77
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unconsciously builds up Chakra
inside the body by rotating it.</font>

78
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... Left... Whether the rotation at
that point is to the right or to the left</font>

79
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">differs in the individual.</font>

80
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, if you imagine
the rotation of the water balloon</font>

81
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">opposite to that of your rotation-type
in this training,</font>

82
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your Chakra flow divides and resists</font>

83
00:04:30,660 --> 00:04:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the momentum of
the rotation does not get on track.</font>

84
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should be able to figure
that kind of stuff on your own.</font>

85
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how did you figure out that
I'm a right-type so fast?</font>

86
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The cowlick on your head!</font>

87
00:04:47,090 --> 00:04:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's pretty much determined that you're
a right type if a whorl rolls to the right</font>

88
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:52,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you're a left-type
if it rolls to the left.</font>

89
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's simple.</font>

90
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, so I have a right roll!</font>

91
00:04:58,230 --> 00:05:02,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, so if you want to rotate it,
you have to imagine a right rotation.</font>

92
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never really paid attention
to that until now...</font>

93
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this Jutsu is just the one for you.</font>

94
00:05:10,790 --> 00:05:15,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hand sign is completely unnecessary.
All you need is Chakra.</font>

95
00:05:15,790 --> 00:05:18,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no need to learn
a finicky hand sign!</font>

96
00:05:19,290 --> 00:05:20,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay to be stupid!</font>

97
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not stupid!</font>

98
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the man who's eventually going
to become Hokage!</font>

99
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's easy once you understand!</font>

100
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:31,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu, I'll completely master it
if I got three days!</font>

101
00:05:32,850 --> 00:05:34,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three days, huh?</font>

102
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:39,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu is a Ninjutsu
that the Fourth Hokage passed on to us.</font>

103
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

104
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It took him three whole years
to perfect this Jutsu...</font>

105
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu is second from the top</font>

106
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:49,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on the six degrees of
difficulty in mastering...</font>

107
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an A-rank, super high-level Ninjutsu.</font>

108
00:05:54,370 --> 00:05:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to learn this move,
there are three steps in the training.</font>

109
00:05:58,830 --> 00:06:01,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This "Water Balloon Breaking"
is the first step.</font>

110
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:08,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It took the genius Ninja,
the Fourth Hokage...</font>

111
00:06:09,590 --> 00:06:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three years...</font>

112
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:14,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point in explaining
anymore to someone</font>

113
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who can't even clear the first step.</font>

114
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do the rest by yourself!</font>

115
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take care!
I'm going to return to the town.</font>

116
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:25,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to gather some information...</font>

117
00:06:26,650 --> 00:06:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What will you do?</font>

118
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-rank in degree of difficulty
in mastering...</font>

119
00:06:33,330 --> 00:06:35,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninjutsu left behind
by the Fourth Hokage...</font>

120
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna go back yet!</font>

121
00:06:46,210 --> 00:06:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...</font>

122
00:06:47,470 --> 00:06:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So long... Don't go overboard with it.</font>

123
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, what will happen?</font>

124
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's something to be concerned about...</font>

125
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mister!</font>

126
00:07:03,690 --> 00:07:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you stop by?</font>

127
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This month is our special service month.</font>

128
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:10,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa! It's a special service month?</font>

129
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The more you visit,
the more you benefit.</font>

130
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:14,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go, a stamp card!</font>

131
00:07:14,830 --> 00:07:16,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you lots and lots of service!</font>

132
00:07:18,790 --> 00:07:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll come, I'll come!</font>

133
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Come on down, Shu!</font>

134
00:07:41,690 --> 00:07:44,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, where is the toilet?</font>

135
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have time to spend three years.</font>

136
00:07:55,370 --> 00:07:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right now!</font>

137
00:07:57,030 --> 00:08:00,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Training, once again today!
I'm gonna work hard like a blaze!</font>

138
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Break! Break! Break!</font>

139
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why won't it break?</font>

140
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jira-chan, you're so naughty!</font>

141
00:08:27,150 --> 00:08:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Men are all naughty!</font>

142
00:08:37,490 --> 00:08:38,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

143
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:45,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three days have passed since
I got the tip from that Pervy Sage...</font>

144
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:49,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rubber is stretched this much,
but why won't it break?</font>

145
00:08:49,670 --> 00:08:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I doing different from
that Pervy Sage?</font>

146
00:08:57,550 --> 00:09:00,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is great! This is so great!</font>

147
00:09:13,190 --> 00:09:14,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?</font>

148
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:23,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa, he stinks of alcohol.</font>

149
00:09:25,830 --> 00:09:27,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna eat now!</font>

150
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

151
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

152
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, damn it!</font>

153
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:45,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Why is it like this?!</font>

154
00:09:55,240 --> 00:10:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No need to learn a finicky hand sign!
It's okay to be stupid!</font>

155
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said that there's no need to form
a hand signal, but...</font>

156
00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:22,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! That's not your toy...</font>

157
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is it!</font>

158
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:44,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and wake up!
Hey, you Pervy Sage!</font>

159
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:48,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... G-Good timing.</font>

160
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you bring me some water...</font>

161
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water?</font>

162
00:10:59,430 --> 00:11:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first step is cleared!</font>

163
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cleared...?</font>

164
00:11:06,350 --> 00:11:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's have you show it to me.</font>

165
00:11:09,350 --> 00:11:12,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Watch it carefully!</font>

166
00:11:17,650 --> 00:11:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Left hand?</font>

167
00:11:31,210 --> 00:11:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

168
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! See that?! See that?!</font>

169
00:11:43,470 --> 00:11:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're sleeping!</font>

170
00:11:47,350 --> 00:11:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, sorry.</font>

171
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm tired from the days and nights
of gathering information.</font>

172
00:11:52,850 --> 00:11:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that seems suspicious to begin with!</font>

173
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still stink of alcohol too!</font>

174
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:01,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nevertheless...</font>

175
00:12:01,610 --> 00:12:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You rotate the water inside the water
balloon that you hold in your left hand</font>

176
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by repeatedly applying it
with your right hand...</font>

177
00:12:08,830 --> 00:12:10,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems little strange of an idea, but...</font>

178
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:12,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an interesting kid.</font>

179
00:12:14,580 --> 00:12:20,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understood the trick pretty well.
It's all thanks to me, though.</font>

180
00:12:22,590 --> 00:12:25,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's thanks to this guy!</font>

181
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

182
00:12:27,970 --> 00:12:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I realized after I saw this cat playing
with the water balloon.</font>

183
00:12:33,690 --> 00:12:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He kept on flicking it with
his paw many times</font>

184
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the water inside shocked
in all different kinds of direction...</font>

185
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it came to me like "bingo"!</font>

186
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did it come like "bingo"?</font>

187
00:12:44,610 --> 00:12:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time when the Pervy Sage
first showed me breaking it...</font>

188
00:12:48,330 --> 00:12:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remembered how the water balloon
surface was not smooth.</font>

189
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until then,
I was always only rotating the water</font>

190
00:12:55,460 --> 00:12:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the one same direction...</font>

191
00:12:58,130 --> 00:13:01,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I realized that the Pervy Sage's
water balloon was not smooth</font>

192
00:13:01,210 --> 00:13:05,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because the water inside was rotating
in different directions.</font>

193
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And after doing it in my own way,
it broke!</font>

194
00:13:11,310 --> 00:13:13,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems it's still not possible for you</font>

195
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to rotate it violently with one hand, but...</font>

196
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I suppose you thought it out
in your own way.</font>

197
00:13:20,770 --> 00:13:22,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just what he expected of me!</font>

198
00:13:23,190 --> 00:13:26,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyhow...
The first step is complete for now.</font>

199
00:13:26,950 --> 00:13:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

200
00:13:28,780 --> 00:13:31,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to see it one more time?
One more time!</font>

201
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow!</font>

202
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You used too much Chakra and
it gradually reached the point</font>

203
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where there's burden
on the Chakra Network...</font>

204
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the next one won't be like this!</font>

205
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. Now, we will proceed
to the second step.</font>

206
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

207
00:13:50,140 --> 00:13:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like we can finally go
into some serious training!</font>

208
00:13:53,430 --> 00:13:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Here you go!
— Huh?</font>

209
00:13:55,640 --> 00:14:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rubber ball?
Something like this again?!</font>

210
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, you'll break this one!</font>

211
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:10,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's one hundred times harder
than the water balloon!</font>

212
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hard...</font>

213
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:27,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first step is rotation,
the second step is force.</font>

214
00:14:28,430 --> 00:14:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since there is no water inside,</font>

215
00:14:30,050 --> 00:14:32,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's more difficult to imagine
the rotation of Chakra,</font>

216
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so it becomes more difficult
to rotate the Chakra as well.</font>

217
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true...</font>

218
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll leave that to your own judgment.</font>

219
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to learn a trick again
to do this, don't I?</font>

220
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:47,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then,
I'll go gather some information.</font>

221
00:14:47,650 --> 00:14:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait, wait!</font>

222
00:14:49,530 --> 00:14:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's train together for
the first time in a while!</font>

223
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't mind if you take a nap.</font>

224
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:55,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't depend on me!</font>

225
00:14:56,290 --> 00:14:59,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must have some kind
of misunderstanding!</font>

226
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did say that I'll teach you the Jutsu,</font>

227
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I don't have the obligation
to teach you every step of the way.</font>

228
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:07,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can't do it by yourself,
then that's it.</font>

229
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be childish forever...
Become more respectable like a Shinobi!</font>

230
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well then.</font>

231
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can at least teach me...
the trick again...</font>

232
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Money!</font>

233
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Money... money... money...</font>

234
00:15:27,150 --> 00:15:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What do you mean
"be respectable like a Shinobi"?!</font>

235
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though you say that,
you're a dirty and greedy adult!</font>

236
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not a respectable Shinobi at all!</font>

237
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:53,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's way more difficult than
the time with the water balloon...</font>

238
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:57,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-And...</font>

239
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:02,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my hands and arms hurt.</font>

240
00:16:30,130 --> 00:16:33,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! How many days am I
going to be doing the same thing!</font>

241
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second from the top in
the difficulty of mastering...</font>

242
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't depend on me!</font>

243
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must have some kind
of misunderstanding!</font>

244
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

245
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:57,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto.</font>

246
00:16:57,820 --> 00:16:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you come here for?</font>

247
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go buy some food from the town below.</font>

248
00:17:02,290 --> 00:17:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Why me?</font>

249
00:17:04,670 --> 00:17:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you...</font>

250
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if for a while, you're still
learning the Jutsu from me.</font>

251
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go, thanks for waiting.</font>

252
00:17:15,630 --> 00:17:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

253
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare he put on a master's face
only at a time like this</font>

254
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when he doesn't teach me anything...</font>

255
00:17:25,230 --> 00:17:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad, buy me some ice cream.</font>

256
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want this one that cracks.</font>

257
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

258
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? I can eat all of it by myself.</font>

259
00:17:39,830 --> 00:17:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope, when you get home,
your mother will have supper ready.</font>

260
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

261
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:53,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... you know...</font>

262
00:17:53,130 --> 00:17:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

263
00:17:54,170 --> 00:17:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you be around my training
for just a while... today?</font>

264
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have time for that.</font>

265
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:04,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to immediately go to town.</font>

266
00:18:06,730 --> 00:18:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unless you think for yourself and
get a grip of the trick for yourself,</font>

267
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:13,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'll never work.</font>

268
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I told you three weeks ago!</font>

269
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be spoiled like a kid.
You are a Ninja.</font>

270
00:18:28,330 --> 00:18:30,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that without
you telling me!</font>

271
00:18:31,420 --> 00:18:33,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just thought I'd ask.</font>

272
00:18:34,090 --> 00:18:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and go,
you Pervy Sage!</font>

273
00:18:37,010 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no, little Jira-chan,
you tell so many lies!</font>

274
00:18:40,470 --> 00:18:43,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?!
Everything is true!</font>

275
00:19:09,830 --> 00:19:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! It doesn't break
no matter how much I try...</font>

276
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:18,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm just dripping away
my Chakra this way.</font>

277
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also...</font>

278
00:19:22,340 --> 00:19:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The more I increase the amount of flow,
the worse the pain gets.</font>

279
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:29,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... How do I say it?</font>

280
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I don't go all out as if
to explode the Chakra,</font>

281
00:19:32,230 --> 00:19:33,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not going to break!</font>

282
00:19:39,990 --> 00:19:40,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

283
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I understand the amount of Chakra
that flows from the pain I feel...</font>

284
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I can bear the pain to the limit
and all at once...</font>

285
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, not yet...</font>

286
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet!</font>

287
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:00,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet... store it!</font>

288
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

289
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:10,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow!</font>

290
00:20:20,070 --> 00:20:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... There seems to have been
a little progress.</font>

291
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!</font>

292
00:20:25,070 --> 00:20:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've still only opened a hole
and it hasn't popped with a bang!</font>

293
00:20:28,290 --> 00:20:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't pretend to be so tough. Here!</font>

294
00:20:34,290 --> 00:20:36,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've done well,
all on your own power.</font>

295
00:20:43,260 --> 00:20:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's so good!</font>

296
00:20:44,840 --> 00:20:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

297
00:20:47,930 --> 00:20:50,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah. Maybe we'll test a bit.</font>

298
00:20:51,180 --> 00:20:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, what?</font>

299
00:20:52,770 --> 00:20:54,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me your right hand.</font>

300
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

301
00:21:09,710 --> 00:21:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

302
00:21:09,710 --> 00:21:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

303
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

304
00:21:14,670 --> 00:21:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

305
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

306
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

307
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

308
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

309
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

310
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

311
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

312
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

313
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

314
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

315
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo nan toka akiramezu ni</font></font></b></font>

316
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we hung on without giving up</font></font></b></font>

317
00:21:52,730 --> 00:21:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo tachi agatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

318
00:21:52,730 --> 00:21:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we kept coming back up</font></font></b></font>

319
00:21:57,430 --> 00:21:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo</font></font></b></font>

320
00:21:57,430 --> 00:22:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we believed and dreamed</font></font></b></font>

321
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">bokura</font></font></b></font>

322
00:22:00,670 --> 00:22:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

323
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">shinjite</font></font></b></font>

324
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

325
00:22:04,610 --> 00:22:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume mite nandomo</font></font></b></font>

326
00:22:07,550 --> 00:22:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo baka o mite kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

327
00:22:07,550 --> 00:22:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've seen fools</font></font></b></font>

328
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo hito no kage ni tatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

329
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've stood in the shadows of others</font></font></b></font>

330
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">saa shuyaku da yo jibun no yume kurai wagamama de isasete</font></font></b></font>

331
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">now, it's our turn... let us bask in our dreams</font></font></b></font>

332
00:22:37,870 --> 00:22:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He tells me
"focus, focus, focus!"</font>

333
00:22:40,250 --> 00:22:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But I've never been good at it, ever.</font>

334
00:22:44,750 --> 00:22:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Speaking of concentration,</font>

335
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Iruka-sensei used to scold me often
at the Ninja Academy</font>

336
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">for my lack of concentration.</font>

337
00:22:52,890 --> 00:22:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Oh... I would've listened to him better
if I knew this would happen.</font>

338
00:22:59,310 --> 00:23:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The Konoha Mark and Forehead Protector."</font>

